Subject: [PATCH bpf-next v5 11/16] bpf: Support stack arguments for kfunc calls
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 20:47:54 -0700
Message-ID: <20260417034754.2630932-1-yonghong.song@linux.dev>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.52.0
In-Reply-To: <20260417034658.2625353-1-yonghong.song@linux.dev>
References: <20260417034658.2625353-1-yonghong.song@linux.dev>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: bpf@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <bpf.vger.kernel.org>
